    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いいですね、百貨店でスイーツの催事ですか。\n今度のオフに行かれるんですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_028_01_a:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_028_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ。私が尊敬するパティシエが出店するんですよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_028_01_a:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_028_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "オリジナリティ溢れるスイーツを考案する方で、\n今回の催事ではイベント限定商品も出すのだとか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_028_01_a:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_028_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それ以外にも様々なスイーツが販売されるので、\n調査のため、張り切って買い集めるつもりです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_028_01_a:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_028_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お話を聞いて、私までワクワクしてきました。\nお目当てのものが買えるといいですね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_028_01_a:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_028_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それで、もしよければ……。\n●●●●プロデューサーさんも一緒に行きませんか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_028_01_a:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_028_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "私一人では全てのスイーツを調査しきれないので、\n事務所にたまたま残っていたあなたを利用したい……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_028_01_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_028_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "んん。いえ、一人よりも二人で行けば、\nきっと楽しいだろうと思いまして。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_028_01_a:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_028_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いいんですか？\n私でよければご一緒させてください！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
